{"id":"0715514b-e27a-412c-9fbc-1b34eee808df","expr":"b != 0 || result == Integer.MIN_VALUE","rationale":"If b is zero, integer division is impossible and the method returns Integer.MIN_VALUE as special sentinel.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Calc#safeDivide(int,int):int","file":"com/example/Calc.java","createdAt":"2026-04-18T06:33:10.897899Z"}
